will hand out notices after school."},{"key":"C","text":"The park clean-up is on Monday."},{"key":"D","text":"Mr. Li will give out food at the hospital."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"give out notices after school。","verify":"\"Anna will hand out notices after school.\""},{"id":"cne_j184_q1","topicId":"cne_j184","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"这辆自行车我买了三年了。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I have had this bike since three years."},{"key":"B","text":"I have had this bike for three years."},{"key":"C","text":"I have bought this bike for three years."},{"key":"D","text":"I have had this bike for three years ago."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"for three years 是一段时间。have had 可以和 for 连用。","verify":"\"I have had this bike for three years.\""},{"id":"cne_j184_q2","topicId":"cne_j184","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"从 2019 年起我就住在这里。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I have lived here for 2019."},{"key":"B","text":"I have lived here since three years."},{"key":"C","text":"I have lived here since 2019."},{"key":"D","text":"I lived here since 2019 and I do not live here now."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"since 2019 是起点。","verify":"\"I have lived here since 2019.\""},{"id":"cne_j184_q3","topicId":"cne_j184","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"for 后面通常接什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一个过去的年份"},{"key":"B","text":"一个星期几的名称单独作起点"},{"key":"C","text":"一个最高级"},{"key":"D","text":"一段时间"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"for three years、for two hours 都是一段时间。","verify":"\"一段时间\""},{"id":"cne_j184_q4","topicId":"cne_j184","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"他从星期一就病了，到现在还病着。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"He has been ill since Monday."},{"key":"B","text":"He has been ill for Monday."},{"key":"C","text":"He was ill since Monday and he is well now in this sentence."},{"key":"D","text":"He has been ill since three days."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"since Monday 表示从星期一开始一直到现在。","verify":"\"He has been ill since Monday.\""}]
